# 16.48 Anti-Hallucination Rules

Minimal:

```text
RULE 01
Never invent citation.

RULE 02
Never invent page number.

RULE 03
Never attribute scholar without evidence.

RULE 04
Never convert possibility into certainty.

RULE 05
Never merge two different narrations silently.

RULE 06
Never state "Ibnu Hajar berkata" without source evidence.

RULE 07
When evidence is insufficient, say so.

RULE 08
Separate source quotation from AI synthesis.
```

